{
 "_note": [
  "Roll-number schemes are institution-specific. 23CS10004 is IIT Kharagpur's;",
  "another institution encodes different things in a different shape. D9 applies a",
  "scheme only when its pattern matches, and abstains otherwise — it never guesses",
  "at an unrecognised format.",
  "",
  "Each scheme names the departments it encodes and how long its programmes run,",
  "because the check is admission_year + programme_length == graduation_year.",
  "Programme durations are India-specific and are the same table D8 needs.",
  "",
  "A second institution is a DATA change and nothing else. Extraction reads these",
  "patterns to FIND roll numbers and D9 reads them to interpret one, so adding an",
  "entry makes both work — which was not true while extraction carried a pattern of",
  "its own."
 ],
